   "text": "tests/summarize.py\n\u2192 tests/results/<id>/summary.md\n\nfailed: requests without 2xx/3xx\nmax_gap_s: longest time without\n  any success = the outage felt\nbefore / during / after:\n  successes per agent\nstatus counts (502, 503, 0 \u2026)\n10 s buckets (recovery ramp)",
   "originalText": "tests/summarize.py\n\u2192 tests/results/<id>/summary.md\n\nfailed: requests without 2xx/3xx\nmax_gap_s: longest time without\n  any success = the outage felt\nbefore / during / after:\n  successes per agent\nstatus counts (502, 503, 0 \u2026)\n10 s buckets (recovery ramp)",
