   "updated": 1793932307465,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example (S3, VIP owner powered off):  app1: total=697 failed=1 max_gap_s=2.2  \u00b7  during {'10.90.20.12': 141}  \u00b7  vip owner after inject: waf-node2\nRead it as: one request lost, 2.2 s without answers while the VIP moved, then node2's HAProxy and agent carried all traffic.\nEvery scenario also checks that exactly ONE node holds the VIP at the end (tools/vip-owner.sh).",
   "originalText": "Example (S3, VIP owner powered off):  app1: total=697 failed=1 max_gap_s=2.2  \u00b7  during {'10.90.20.12': 141}  \u00b7  vip owner after inject: waf-node2\nRead it as: one request lost, 2.2 s without answers while the VIP moved, then node2's HAProxy and agent carried all traffic.\nEvery scenario also checks that exactly ONE node holds the VIP at the end (tools/vip-owner.sh).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
